HWysbvRQEkHPZO6Hut58C8dErHzG7AV_cJjwl-BaZ47DZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvDwYCwox9d6L_h7DwZK2u5y3ZB5gEDgzIIYnMZN7ozlg&oe=699C3F74"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fencing-vr Landscape.png", "id": "1105385768373296", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1105385771706629_1526644266772282750_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MhC6-Knb970Q7kNvwFWhoiR&_nc_oc=AdlveMWtm06KvgxOuBv2zMwfJJCPYw1bbgR4tWefg_JYjpQLwQbNX2O1TQxTClXf9kg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsguFsxmSu575Q8i3up6jdhonYG6ZtSABsnYNXFbLWl0Q&oe=699C3292"}, "display_name": "Fencing VR: En Garde Arena", "keywords": ["Combat", "swords", "duel", "battle", "clash"], "long_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience the world's most elegant combat sport with unparalleled realism in Fencing game.\n\nPowered by a realistic fencing physics , every parry, lunge, and touch\u00e9 feels authentic. Master the blade in a true test of wits, reflexes, and strategy.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\nMASTER 3 DISCIPLINES: Duel against advanced AI opponents in Foil, \u00c9p\u00e9e, and Sabre to perfect your technique in every style.\n\nGLOBAL MULTIPLAYER: Challenge players worldwide in tactical, head-to-head Foil duels, where strategy is everything.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY: Full support for both immersive, athletic Roomscale VR and accessible, quick-play Stationary VR.\n\n\nHone your skills, find your rhythm, and prove your worth on the piste.", "short_description": "Step onto the virtual piste! Experience intense duels powered by realistic physics and true 1:1 motion tracking where every touch\u00e9 feels real.\n\nChallenge players worldwide in ranked multiplayer, master your technique in the Training Academy, and customize your gear to create a champion.\n\nYour honor is on the line. The Arena awaits. En Garde!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.abstron.com/privacy.html"